---
import Layout from "~/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Top People Ops AI Assistant | OllaSuper"
  description="Streamline HR with a secure people ops AI assistant. Automate onboarding, answer employee FAQs, and cut admin costs by 80% with OllaSuper. Get started."
  current="solutions"
>
  <article class="os-section" style="background: var(--bg-soft); padding-top: 64px; padding-bottom: 80px;">
    <div class="os-container" style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <h1 class="os-h1" style="margin-bottom: 32px; font-size: 3rem;">People Ops AI Assistant</h1>
      
      <p class="os-lead" style="margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 1.8;">
        Managing modern human resources requires juggling compliance, onboarding, employee engagement, and endless administrative requests. If your HR team is drowning in repetitive tasks, integrating a dedicated <strong>people ops AI assistant</strong> is the most effective way to reclaim their time. 
      </p>

      <p class="os-lead" style="margin-bottom: 48px; line-height: 1.8;">
        At OllaSuper, we build autonomous AI employees specifically designed to handle the heavy lifting of people operations. Your new people ops AI assistant seamlessly integrates into your existing HRIS, Slack, and email systems to automatically resolve tier-1 employee inquiries, manage complex onboarding workflows, and process time-off requests with zero manual intervention. Because our agents utilize secure, human-in-the-loop approval gates, you retain total control over sensitive HR data while drastically reducing administrative friction. Let your human HR leaders focus on culture, strategy, and talent retention. Deploy a digital people ops assistant today to automate the busywork, improve employee response times, and scale your HR capabilities effortlessly.
      </p>

      <h2 class="os-h2" style="margin-top: 48px; margin-bottom: 16px;">Why Your HR Team Needs a People Ops AI Assistant</h2>
      <h3 class="os-h3" style="color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 24px;">Escaping the Administrative Trap</h3>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 32px; color: var(--text-body); line-height: 1.7;">
        HR leaders often spend up to 70% of their day answering the same employee policy questions and chasing down onboarding documentation. A dedicated AI assistant handles this tier-1 support autonomously, freeing your team for strategic work.
      </p>

      <h2 class="os-h2" style="margin-top: 48px; margin-bottom: 16px;">Core Capabilities of the OllaSuper HR Agent</h2>
      
      <h3 class="os-h3" style="color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 12px;">Automated Onboarding & Offboarding Workflows</h3>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 24px; color: var(--text-body); line-height: 1.7;">
        From provisioning software licenses to sending compliance documents, the agent orchestrates the entire onboarding checklist across multiple platforms perfectly, every single time.
      </p>

      <h3 class="os-h3" style="color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 12px;">24/7 Employee Policy & Benefits Support</h3>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 24px; color: var(--text-body); line-height: 1.7;">
        Employees can ask questions in Slack about PTO, healthcare benefits, and company policies, and receive instant, accurate answers drawn directly from your verified employee handbook.
      </p>

      <h3 class="os-h3" style="color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 12px;">Secure Data Handling and Confidentiality</h3>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 32px; color: var(--text-body); line-height: 1.7;">
        OllaSuper agents are built with enterprise-grade security. Human-in-the-loop gates ensure that sensitive actions, such as finalizing payroll changes, always require human authorization before execution.
      </p>

      <h2 class="os-h2" style="margin-top: 48px; margin-bottom: 16px;">Integrating Your AI Assistant with Existing HRIS Tools</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 32px; color: var(--text-body); line-height: 1.7;">
        Through native Model Context Protocol (MCP) integrations, your People Ops AI Assistant connects securely with platforms like Workday, BambooHR, Gusto, and more, allowing it to act directly within your existing tech stack.
      </p>

      <h2 class="os-h2" style="margin-top: 48px; margin-bottom: 24px;">Transform Your People Operations Today</h2>
      <a href="https://app.ollasuper.com/login" class="os-btn os-btn-primary" style="padding: 12px 32px;">Deploy Your Digital HR Assistant →</a>

    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
